# NetPulse starter manuf file (Wireshark "manuf" format)
#
# This is a SMALL starter set so vendor lookup works end-to-end.
# For best results, replace this file with the full Wireshark manuf database.
# (Search "Wireshark manuf file" and use the official latest copy.)
#
# Format:
# <OUI or prefix> <shortName> <longName...>
#
# Examples:
# 00:00:0C        Cisco       Cisco Systems, Inc
# B8:27:EB        RPi         Raspberry Pi (Trading) Ltd

00:00:0C        Cisco       Cisco Systems, Inc
B8:27:EB        RPi         Raspberry Pi (Trading) Ltd
